{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on the real-life practices of forensic analysts, we have created mechanics that allow the player to understand and uncover the truth behind the evidence they find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a taser, the choice is up to you, are you going to run and hide, or stand and fight? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/9dabe297edfa4ea1abfe7884d542c160.poster.avif?t=1773407976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/9dabe297edfa4ea1abfe7884d542c160.webm?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/9dabe297edfa4ea1abfe7884d542c160.mp4?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you wade through the dark halls of House Haywood, you will find meaning in blood.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Charles Dalton, a forensics analyst who specializes in blood spatter, tasked with using his expert skill set to solve the disappearances of multiple persons in the snowy region of Haywood. In the darkness of a Tudor mansion, you hear the foghorn blow. You are not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/41cbc1514ec0a9e4d24bd3ed7863d896.poster.avif?t=1773407976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/41cbc1514ec0a9e4d24bd3ed7863d896.webm?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/41cbc1514ec0a9e4d24bd3ed7863d896.mp4?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ENVIRONMENT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the dimly lit halls of an ancient home to the haze-covered docks of Haywood itself, journey through handcrafted environments to look for evidence that will help you in your journey. Be sure to search every nook and cranny, as there is a story to be told in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/a637ae6c407f2dd807efd7a3a9bd5d20.poster.avif?t=1773407976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/a637ae6c407f2dd807efd7a3a9bd5d20.webm?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/a637ae6c407f2dd807efd7a3a9bd5d20.mp4?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMurder is seldom senseless, it's targeted.\u201d </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Charles Dalton</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Haywood you look at that!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/79dc569ee3118d26a7a488cfc32d24e69b7d13ff.jpg"},{"name":"Let There Be Light!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/2ba0f7daec639586532933f2513453d03849683c.jpg"},{"name":"Every Drop Counts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/134a4c157ab406efc61145dee618369b237bef36.jpg"},{"name":"Gone in a Flash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/cc976c1701a5812bc8e748f073145984384fa0d7.jpg"},{"name":"Greenlight the Knight!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/0f49e867f6ae3555fc97ac4449e812b23ca834fd.jpg"},{"name":"Down The Shaft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/850fe288352addd3fe385c9fed9b2da8969e180d.jpg"},{"name":"You\u2019ve Found Your \"Why?\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/51809e38c98aa64073b0096abe4f575408e2a75f.jpg"},{"name":"Case Closed\u2026?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/6d5c7492abed118cbb52ea8fc3ffcb02202e5393.jpg"},{"name":"Beneath the Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/058fea3795d3443239d9a1190d0e39c119e83f96.jpg"},{"name":"The Sky Looks Amazing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062610/f643a19dff9ae724024f49544d2323497b51f9c2.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3062610?t=1773407976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/6e8ed54118d2b756cf0cd28c61c172116b9ae1d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773407976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/8eccf9d668d51bde28d4eb3346e643423baa9047/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773407976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/8eccf9d668d51bde28d4eb3346e643423baa9047/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773407976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>OVERVIEW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Mode:</strong> The ultimate challenge. Face the mystery with permanent death and no saving. One mistake ends it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Mode:</strong> Explore at your own pace. The stalker is removed, allowing you to focus purely on forensic puzzles and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Festive Decorations:</strong> Toggle holiday spirit on or off. Deck the halls of the Tudor mansion, but don't expect the lights to hide the shadows.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on the real-life practices of forensic analysts, we have created mechanics that allow the player to understand and uncover the truth behind the evidence they find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a taser, the choice is up to you, are you going to run and hide, or stand and fight? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/9dabe297edfa4ea1abfe7884d542c160.poster.avif?t=1773407976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/9dabe297edfa4ea1abfe7884d542c160.webm?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/9dabe297edfa4ea1abfe7884d542c160.mp4?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you wade through the dark halls of House Haywood, you will find meaning in blood.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Charles Dalton, a forensics analyst who specializes in blood spatter, tasked with using his expert skill set to solve the disappearances of multiple persons in the snowy region of Haywood. In the darkness of a Tudor mansion, you hear the foghorn blow. You are not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/41cbc1514ec0a9e4d24bd3ed7863d896.poster.avif?t=1773407976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/41cbc1514ec0a9e4d24bd3ed7863d896.webm?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/41cbc1514ec0a9e4d24bd3ed7863d896.mp4?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ENVIRONMENT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the dimly lit halls of an ancient home to the haze-covered docks of Haywood itself, journey through handcrafted environments to look for evidence that will help you in your journey. Be sure to search every nook and cranny, as there is a story to be told in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/a637ae6c407f2dd807efd7a3a9bd5d20.poster.avif?t=1773407976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/a637ae6c407f2dd807efd7a3a9bd5d20.webm?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/a637ae6c407f2dd807efd7a3a9bd5d20.mp4?t=1773407976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMurder is seldom senseless, it's targeted.\u201d </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Charles Dalton</strong></p>","developers":["Blue Hat Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/beaebc3ff3819ab67685da82777e16019247af1e/header.jpg?t=1773407976","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/1388215619/b790fd3ca7de82095cd6445b3b5151cdd15ce586/1764677240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764678873","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/1388215619/b790fd3ca7de82095cd6445b3b5151cdd15ce586/1764677240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764678873","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/1388215619/b790fd3ca7de82095cd6445b3b5151cdd15ce586/1764677240/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764678873","id":257242397,"name":"She's Leaving - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257242397/d3f0aace05d00b3beef25a80b6094c90f78a3b81/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764678873"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/23762760/4f39f5ecfdff94b8ee8a58946f854e05c3c31753/1764075524/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764076519","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/23762760/4f39f5ecfdff94b8ee8a58946f854e05c3c31753/1764075524/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764076519","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/23762760/4f39f5ecfdff94b8e